  "scope": "Complete controlled supported straightening theorem from the actual submanifold definition: every sufficiently small positive radius has a global class-k diffeomorphism and inverse, both Lipschitz bounds 1/t, identity outside the open radius-r ball and exact affine-tangent-plane membership inside radius tr. Proved opaque smooth annular cutoff, scaled derivative bound, actual graph-tangent identification, product estimate and the printed open/proper/closed surjectivity route. Three regressions, including zero ambient/manifold dimensions and translated centres.",
